WEBVTT

00:16:59.633 --> 00:17:01.216
I do enjoy it.

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:05.096
And I get lots and lots of kids coming.

00:17:05.119 --> 00:17:10.336
I'm a contaminator for all those children
of investment bankers -- wankers.

00:17:10.359 --> 00:17:11.576
Sorry.

00:17:11.599 --> 00:17:13.536
(Laughter)

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:16.376
That's a solar seed.
It's a concept for new architecture.

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:20.136
That thing on the top is the world's
first solar-powered garden lamp --

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:21.896
the first produced.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:24.096
Giles Revell should be
talking here today --

00:17:24.119 --> 00:17:26.336
amazing photography
of things you can't see.

00:17:26.359 --> 00:17:30.360
The first sculptural model
I made for that thing in Tokyo.